WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.620
Welcome everyone. Today, we're going to explore a critical skill that can empower each of us to become an everyday hero.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.140
We're talking about CPR and the use of an AED for all ages.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.940
First, let's consider what it means to be an everyday hero.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:19.940
It's about being ready to step up when someone's life is on the line.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.820
CPR and AED use are vital skills that can make a difference in those crucial moments.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:30.980
Regardless of age or background, anyone can learn these life-saving techniques.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:38.080
Our goal is to equip you with the knowledge and confidence you need to act swiftly and effectively in an emergency.

00:00:38.459 --> 00:00:44.180
Let's dive into this journey together and embrace the opportunity to become heroes in our communities.

